Sketch the circle $x^{2}+y^{2}=20$, showing the centre and all intercepts in simplest surd form.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}, scale=0.5]
\draw[<->] (-6,0)--(6,0) node[right] {$x$};
\draw[<->] (0,-6)--(0,6) node[above] {$y$};
