development.solution_text:
$x^{2}+y^{2}=20$
$r=\sqrt{20}=2\sqrt{5}$
Centre $(0,0)$ and radius $2\sqrt{5}\approx4.5$, with intercepts at $(\pm2\sqrt{5},0)$ and $(0,\pm2\sqrt{5})$.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}, scale=0.5]
\draw[<->] (-6,0)--(6,0) node[right] {$x$};
\draw[<->] (0,-6)--(0,6) node[above] {$y$};
\draw[thick,blue] (0,0) circle (4.472);
\fill (0,0) circle (3pt);
\node[below left] at (0,0) {$O$};
\fill (4.472,0) circle (3pt);
\node[below right] at (4.472,0) {$2\sqrt{5}$};
\fill (-4.472,0) circle (3pt);
\node[below left] at (-4.472,0) {$-2\sqrt{5}$};
\fill (0,4.472) circle (3pt);
\node[above left] at (0,4.472) {$2\sqrt{5}$};
\fill (0,-4.472) circle (3pt);
\node[below right] at (0,-4.472) {$-2\sqrt{5}$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
